{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And the city shall be broad</b> — the opposite of \"and they made the desirable land a desolation\" [Daniel 8:9, reading ארץ חמדה for the similar phrase there]."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra's phrase 'וישימו ארך חמדה לשמה' appears to allude to Jeremiah 12:10 or Daniel 8:9; the closest verbal parallel is Daniel 8:9 ('וישחת ארץ צביה'), while 'ארץ חמדה' occurs in Daniel 11:16, 41; the exact verse intended is uncertain."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:20.421635986Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}